              "type": "paragraph",
              "runs": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Sam opened with the 1440 px mockups and asked whether the row height felt tight."
                },
                {
                  "kind": "timestamp",
                  "text": "18:10",
                  "t": 1090
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": " Priya agreed that a pill on every row made the list busy. The proposal to show pills only for completed or running stages, and a quiet caption for audio-only recordings, was accepted without objection."
                },
                {
                  "kind": "timestamp",
                  "text": "19:05",
                  "t": 1145
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": " On the dark theme, Lee argued that Windows users switch themes with the system and a light-only first release would look unfinished; nobody disagreed."
                },
                {
                  "kind": "timestamp",
                  "text": "41:10",
                  "t": 2470
                }
              ]
